+## Board Publication
+
+Publishing a board makes it publicly accessible to anyone with its secret `public_url`. Only board administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board, generating a secret public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
